To address decision automation, we require explicit validation by an agent before any automated decisions are made. This ensures that agents have control over and visibility into the decision-making process.

Overall, I believe our existing security measures and AI security controls can help meet the City of Belval's requirements for protecting personal data, ensuring GDPR compliance, and implementing secure decision automation processes.
