The project has a global budget of 3,000,000 euros and a duration of 4 years. We will ensure that the solution is designed to reduce energetic consumption and rely on infrastructure with low carbon impact. Our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, margins for infrastructure and software licenses, and we are committed to minimizing waste and reducing costs.

Our company has experience in providing cloud hosting on SecNumCloud, OVHCloud, and Scaleway infrastructure, and we have expertise in technologies such as Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), Helm, Terraform, and Ansible. We will ensure that the solution is compliant with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and that all data is protected in an appropriate manner.

We believe that our proposed solution meets the requirements of the City of Belval, providing an intelligent assistance tool that improves the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users, while ensuring the protection of personal data and reducing energetic consumption. We are committed to delivering a high-quality solution that meets the needs of the local authority and its agents.
